691 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Strengths Strong, Trusted Community Presence Healing Justice Santa Barbara, as an organization, is deeply grounded in the lived experience of the Black community. Their consistent efforts since 2020 have bridged institutions and the Black community, fostering trust within the local community. HJSB led one of the largest direct actions in the history of Santa Barbara during the Black Lives Matter movement in 2020, mobilizing thousands into action and advocacy around grief, protest, and collective healing and support. [1] The organization is also often called on by institutions when racial incidents occur, such as their partnership with Riviera Ridge High School, demonstrating their strong network within Santa Barbara and institutional trust.[2])
/E (Strengths Strong, Trusted Community Presence Healing Justice Santa Barbara, as an organization, is deeply grounded in the lived experience of the Black community. Their consistent efforts since 2020 have bridged institutions and the Black community, fostering trust within the local community. HJSB led one of the largest direct actions in the history of Santa Barbara during the Black Lives Matter movement in 2020, mobilizing thousands into action and advocacy around grief, protest, and collective healing and support. [1] The organization is also often called on by institutions when racial incidents occur, such as their partnership with Riviera Ridge High School, demonstrating their strong network within Santa Barbara and institutional trust.[2])
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
