699 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Innovative, Year-Round Programming HJSB has established itself as a leader in establishing consistent and innovative programming that centers Black expression and storytelling in Santa Barbara. They launched and operated the Black femme-owned art and event venue Melanin Gallery in 2021, which featured exclusively Black artists and allowed them to retain 100% of their sales. They have also offered free therapy for the Black community, have provided the Emergency Needs Fund to address urgent financial barriers for Black individuals and families, and are holding the second annual Black is Beautiful Gala, an event that celebrates Black community and voices. [4])
/E (Innovative, Year-Round Programming HJSB has established itself as a leader in establishing consistent and innovative programming that centers Black expression and storytelling in Santa Barbara. They launched and operated the Black femme-owned art and event venue Melanin Gallery in 2021, which featured exclusively Black artists and allowed them to retain 100% of their sales. They have also offered free therapy for the Black community, have provided the Emergency Needs Fund to address urgent financial barriers for Black individuals and families, and are holding the second annual Black is Beautiful Gala, an event that celebrates Black community and voices. [4])
