708 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Heavy Dependence on Grantors  Healing Justice Santa Barbara has a large dependence on grantors in order to keep things running. Due to this dependence on outside sources, the non-profit feels vulnerable to slowdowns or cuts. Co-Founders Leticia and Simone stated that they are always looking for potential grantors to continue building Healing Justice and expanding their community reach. This dedication shows their commitment, but also highlights the challenge of the constant pressure to secure funding and how it can pull them away from developing Healing Justice even further. Without a constant stream of income, they are at risk of falling out of priority for potential grantors. Building a more sustainable income stream will take Healing Justice Santa Barbara far with growth. [8])
/E (Heavy Dependence on Grantors  Healing Justice Santa Barbara has a large dependence on grantors in order to keep things running. Due to this dependence on outside sources, the non-profit feels vulnerable to slowdowns or cuts. Co-Founders Leticia and Simone stated that they are always looking for potential grantors to continue building Healing Justice and expanding their community reach. This dedication shows their commitment, but also highlights the challenge of the constant pressure to secure funding and how it can pull them away from developing Healing Justice even further. Without a constant stream of income, they are at risk of falling out of priority for potential grantors. Building a more sustainable income stream will take Healing Justice Santa Barbara far with growth. [8])
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
