/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Small Staff and Budget  Healing Justice Santa Barbara works with a small team, with eight members between their collective and board. [10] Running a non-profit with a limited team and budget runs the risk of burnout and loss of opportunity due to not having enough hands to distribute the work with. This, alongside a limited budget, adds another layer of strain to the operation, as it restricts the ability to add more employees to the team. While Healing Justice Santa Barbara shows great determination with the resources they currently have, growing the non-profit will require a constant income stream for a sustainable future. )
/E (Small Staff and Budget  Healing Justice Santa Barbara works with a small team, with eight members between their collective and board. [10] Running a non-profit with a limited team and budget runs the risk of burnout and loss of opportunity due to not having enough hands to distribute the work with. This, alongside a limited budget, adds another layer of strain to the operation, as it restricts the ability to add more employees to the team. While Healing Justice Santa Barbara shows great determination with the resources they currently have, growing the non-profit will require a constant income stream for a sustainable future. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
