/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Address Racist Bullying in Schools  Multiple horrific instances of discrimination in Santa Barbara schools have come out, including physical violence and use of slurs, with one instance in 2022 even resulting in two mothers suing the school district for their lack of protective measures. A 2023 report also showed that students were almost never punished for utilizing slurs against African American students and that the district had zero policies in place to protect Black students. [12] This opens an opportunity for Healing Justice Santa Barbara to expand its presence in schools by building and supporting Black Student Unions, giving students a safe space to organize, lead, and advocate for change.)
/E (Address Racist Bullying in Schools  Multiple horrific instances of discrimination in Santa Barbara schools have come out, including physical violence and use of slurs, with one instance in 2022 even resulting in two mothers suing the school district for their lack of protective measures. A 2023 report also showed that students were almost never punished for utilizing slurs against African American students and that the district had zero policies in place to protect Black students. [12] This opens an opportunity for Healing Justice Santa Barbara to expand its presence in schools by building and supporting Black Student Unions, giving students a safe space to organize, lead, and advocate for change.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
