/E (Meet Charitable Chelly! Chelly is a 65-year-old African-American Santa Barbara resident who is transitioning into retirement and seeking purpose through civic engagement.\(4\) With an annual income of $180,000 and a strong commitment to improving inclusion and equity in her community, Chelly is eager to invest her time, energy, and resources into causes that reflect her values. Currently, she stays connected through community boards, donor events, and philanthropic networks, and is driven by her desire to use her resources for a good cause.\(5\) Having personally experienced the detrimental effects of systemic racism, she is dedicated to breaking the cycle )
