/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Second, HJSB will directly connect donors to the student ambassador program by hosting annual donor workshops. In these workshops, donors with business, marketing, or communications expertise will be invited to share skills such as social media strategy, videography, or trend analysis with student ambassadors. This not only provides donors with hands-on purpose within the organization, but also gives students professional development, mentorship, and networking opportunities. Donors become co-creators of impact, reinforcing their long-term commitment while cultivating pride in their contributions.)
/Pg 30 0 R
