826 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Additionally, youth engagement will be key to ensuring that this program is long-lasting. As this program is reliant on students, it is imperative that students will continue with the program and not quit. To track student engagement, we will track meeting attendance to ensure we are not losing ambassadors and number of videos ambassadors post per week. We are hoping for minimum 2 videos a week per student to stay consistent in the algorithm. Lastly, we will measure donor participation outside of monetary donations. As we hope this program will also allow donors to provide more hands-on opportunities to teach workshops, we will track donor participation interest. We hope to host a minimum of 2 workshops per year.)
/E (Additionally, youth engagement will be key to ensuring that this program is long-lasting. As this program is reliant on students, it is imperative that students will continue with the program and not quit. To track student engagement, we will track meeting attendance to ensure we are not losing ambassadors and number of videos ambassadors post per week. We are hoping for minimum 2 videos a week per student to stay consistent in the algorithm. Lastly, we will measure donor participation outside of monetary donations. As we hope this program will also allow donors to provide more hands-on opportunities to teach workshops, we will track donor participation interest. We hope to host a minimum of 2 workshops per year.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [2]
