/T ( To measure program success, HJSB will track outcomes in both student development and donor engagement. For students, pre- and post-program surveys will assess confidence with a goal of achieving a 20% improvement. Additionally, more than 80% of mentees are expected to secure significant roles within one year of participation. For donors, success will be reflected in retention and involvement, with a target of at least 75% of donors continuing to mentor or fund the program into Year 2, and 60% of invited donors attending at least one program offering. )
