/T (Web development and integration of a secure donor-only section with password protection is reasonably estimated at around $1,000, based on mid-level developer rates averaging $60-$100 per hour and a 10-15 hour development timeline. According to nonprofit website cost guides, custom website features such as gated content, login portals, and secure file downloads typically require 10-15 hours to develop at rates within this range, especially if using WordPress or similar CMS platforms. \(29\)\(30\)  This aligns with industry-standard freelance developer pricing and the complexity involved in building secure donor access areas for nonprofits. SEO optimization plus analytics setup can be budgeted at $400 for 4-6 hours of specialist work.\(31\) This breakdown totals $3,500, delivering a polished, functional, and donor-engaging portal without exceeding budget constraints.)
/E (Web development and integration of a secure donor-only section with password protection is reasonably estimated at around $1,000, based on mid-level developer rates averaging $60-$100 per hour and a 10-15 hour development timeline. According to nonprofit website cost guides, custom website features such as gated content, login portals, and secure file downloads typically require 10-15 hours to develop at rates within this range, especially if using WordPress or similar CMS platforms. \(29\)\(30\)  This aligns with industry-standard freelance developer pricing and the complexity involved in building secure donor access areas for nonprofits. SEO optimization plus analytics setup can be budgeted at $400 for 4-6 hours of specialist work.\(31\) This breakdown totals $3,500, delivering a polished, functional, and donor-engaging portal without exceeding budget constraints.)
