/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Measurement \(KPI\) Success will be measured by monthly portal visits, downloads of impact reports, and new donor registrations for the password-protected area. Web analytics and CRM integration \(e.g., Google Analytics with donation tracking\) will allow HJSB to directly attribute donations to portal engagement. KPIs include a 25% increase in online donations within six months, at least 15 new legacy gift inquiries in the first year, and a measurable uptick in donor retention rates among portal users compared to non-users. Additional success indicators include increased average donation size, industry benchmarks show donors give more when they see transparent reporting and recognition features,\(32\) and higher repeat visitation to donor pages. By creating a dynamic, data-driven, and donor-centered portal, HJSB will position itself as both an accountable and inspiring nonprofit, driving trust, credibility, and ultimately, more sustained funding.)
/E (Measurement \(KPI\) Success will be measured by monthly portal visits, downloads of impact reports, and new donor registrations for the password-protected area. Web analytics and CRM integration \(e.g., Google Analytics with donation tracking\) will allow HJSB to directly attribute donations to portal engagement. KPIs include a 25% increase in online donations within six months, at least 15 new legacy gift inquiries in the first year, and a measurable uptick in donor retention rates among portal users compared to non-users. Additional success indicators include increased average donation size, industry benchmarks show donors give more when they see transparent reporting and recognition features,\(32\) and higher repeat visitation to donor pages. By creating a dynamic, data-driven, and donor-centered portal, HJSB will position itself as both an accountable and inspiring nonprofit, driving trust, credibility, and ultimately, more sustained funding.)
